   "fix": "Add `@[simp] theorem mul_chartGenerator_apply : (mul \ud835\udc9c U m n (chartGenerator m f hf U hU) (chartGenerator n f hf U hU)).1 x = (chartGenerator (m + n) f hf U hU).1 x`. Derive `chartGenerator_mul_neg_apply` from it or keep that lemma as the special case n = -m.",
